  "description": "Generates a per-page Content-Security-Policy. At the end of rendering, each page's inline scripts (and, optionally, styles) are SHA-256 hashed and a Content-Security-Policy meta tag is injected into the head, with a `'self'`-based directive set tuned for self-hosted static sites. Pairs with NuStreamDocs.Privacy (run after it so localized assets need no extra origins). No JavaScript, no build-phase work; host-agnostic.",
